Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.48,0:00:26.38,Italics - Top,Serafina,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.63,0:00:30.70,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Shackles?! On my legs as well?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.13,0:00:34.63,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,And a collar?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.97,0:00:43.56,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I see. It appears I've \Nbeen taken prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.30,0:00:47.39,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,After being defeated by mere barbarians...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.05,0:01:06.48,Time/Setting,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,350)}1342 Anno Draconis\NIn the east of the continent—\N\NBarbarian Territory
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.95,0:01:35.82,Flashback,Illdoren Commander,0,0,0,,Rifle brigade, take positions!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.08,0:01:40.32,Flashback,Illdoren Commander,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.81,0:01:46.33,Flashback,Illdoren Commander,0,0,0,,Keep shooting!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.70,0:01:51.63,Flashback,Illodren Lieutenant,0,0,0,,Captain! The barbarians' \Nresistance is too fierce!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.63,0:01:53.11,Flashback,Illodren Lieutenant,0,0,0,,The volunteer troops are wiped out,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.11,0:01:55.09,Flashback,Illodren Lieutenant,0,0,0,,and front line of our \Nleft wing has collapsed!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.41,0:01:58.59,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,Compose yourself! Or are you not a knight \Nof Illodren's Eastern Expedition?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.32,0:02:00.87,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,Have the left wing pull back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.87,0:02:04.50,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,Extend the center and right outwards \Ninto a partial wing formation!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:08.76,Flashback - Top,Serafina,0,0,0,,We'll deflect the savages' attacks \Nand begin a fighting retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.49,0:02:09.23,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1450,0)\p1\an5\pos(177,295.333)\bord0\shad0\c&HD9F4F4&}m 10 0 l 185 0 l 195 10 l 195 50 l 185 60 l 185 60 l 10 60 l 0 50 l 0 10
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.49,0:02:09.23,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1450,0)\fnGeorgia\fs16\pos(177,295.333)\an5\c&H3E3C90&\3c&HD9F4F4&\shad0\bord1}Illdoren Kingdom\N Eastern Expeditionary Force\NFirst Company Captain\N Serafina de Lavillant
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.55,0:02:21.30,Flashback_Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Still, even if we're able \Nto force our way past them,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.30,0:02:23.24,Flashback_Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,we've lost too many from our \Nprimary forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.24,0:02:26.85,Flashback_Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Any further losses will affect \Nour chances of returning home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.17,0:02:31.25,Flashback_Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,This will mark the end of the seven-year \Nlong 17th Eastern Expedition...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.25,0:02:34.66,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,I need to ensure as many of my comrades \Nreturn home alive as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.97,0:02:57.63,Flashback - Top,Veor,0,0,0,,That crystal helmet...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.78,0:03:00.07,Flashback - Top,Veor,0,0,0,,I take it you're \Nthe Eastern Expedition's general?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.62,0:03:00.08,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1450,0)\p1\an5\pos(109.333,296)\bord0\shad0\c&HDFF6F7&}m 10 0 l 160 0 l 170 10 l 170 60 l 160 70 l 160 70 l 10 70 l 0 60 l 0 10
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.62,0:03:00.08,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1450,0)\fnGeorgia\fs20\pos(109.333,296)\an5\c&H3E3C90&\3c&HD9F4F4&\shad0\bord1\fscy120}"Thundering Voice"\N{\fs28}Veor
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.39,0:03:03.96,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,I've grown tired facing \Nthese mere foot soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.36,0:03:06.83,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,Will you face me alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.66,0:03:10.33,Flashback_Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Of all the times for one \Nof their elite to appear...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.99,0:03:14.61,Flashback_Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,But if I ignore someone with a blade \Nthat can shred plate armor like paper,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.61,0:03:16.10,Flashback_Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,the withdrawal will never succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.33,0:03:18.99,Flashback_Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Is it overconfidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.99,0:03:21.34,Flashback_Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,If they're willing to take \Nthis into individual combat,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.34,0:03:22.34,Flashback_Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,I have no reason to refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.82,0:03:23.69,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,Lieutenant!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.69,0:03:24.60,Flashback,Lieutenant,0,0,0,,Y-Yes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.16,0:03:26.93,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,Numbers will do us no \Ngood against that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.42,0:03:28.89,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,You must take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.89,0:03:32.35,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,Let my brother know that I gave \Nmy life in service to my homeland!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.85,0:04:02.38,Flashback_Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Princess Wysteresia! \NPlease, lend me your strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.41,0:04:21.73,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,This is as far as I go...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.81,0:04:26.99,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,Well done. There are few who have \Nstood against me as long as you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.11,0:04:29.82,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,Kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.82,0:04:31.25,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,I refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.33,0:04:35.74,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,Instead, you will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.34,0:04:40.69,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,Fear not. You survival isn't in question.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.69,0:04:45.29,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,Not when I can think of \Ngood uses for that body.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.11,0:04:58.67,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,That's right... I was... \Ntaken away as his spoils.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.31,0:05:03.11,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,W-Will they be putting me to work \Nin the fields, like livestock?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.11,0:05:07.81,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,No, torture to learn what\Nthey can will likely come first...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.16,0:05:13.07,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,They took me alive. I have to imagine \Nthat was done with a plan in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.74,0:05:18.29,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,Not when I can think of \Ngood uses for that body.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.10,0:05:22.59,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I-I hate to even consider it...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.98,0:05:26.04,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,but if I was captured \Nbecause I'm a woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.18,0:05:32.55,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Will they make sport of me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.22,0:05:38.58,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,What a shameful state of affairs \Nfor an unmarried noble woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.58,0:05:42.19,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Am I in the den of a pack of animals?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.93,0:05:46.86,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,And what's become of the troops \Nwho swore to fight for me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.66,0:05:49.77,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,The amount of time I was able to buy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.77,0:05:53.39,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,couldn't possibly have been enough \Nfor an organized withdrawal!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.39,0:05:55.30,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Even if the rear was able to get away,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.30,0:05:57.83,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,the front lines would have\Nbeen broken into pieces...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.86,0:06:03.39,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Likely either struck down\Nor wasting away in the wilds...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.64,0:06:07.84,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,But more pressing than that...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.35,0:06:15.97,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Without control over the eastern \Nlands, where the barbarians rule,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.53,0:06:18.39,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,the people of the capital will...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.99,0:06:30.14,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,The frustration of being unable \Nto defend the people's livelihood,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.14,0:06:31.27,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,as is a noble's duty...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.85,0:06:35.15,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,You're certainly taking the "noble" \Npart of the title literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.48,0:06:38.30,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.03,0:06:46.00,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,My name is Cersei. \NI serve the man who captured you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.37,0:06:50.63,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.23,0:06:55.08,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Are you here to press me for intelligence?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.69,0:06:59.10,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Intelligence? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.48,0:07:02.60,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Do not play ignorant, barbarian girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.60,0:07:04.43,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,You're here to use \Nthose strange implements
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.43,0:07:07.09,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,to force me to talk, aren't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.69,0:07:10.74,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,I was only given one command.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.23,0:07:14.19,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,To make sure that you, \Nhis victory trophy,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.19,0:07:16.99,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,are in a condition that is to his liking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.29,0:07:19.00,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Trophy...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.86,0:07:25.96,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,W-What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.21,0:07:29.51,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious? It'll be harder \Nif you're able to struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.47,0:07:34.20,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,So, it begins...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.61,0:07:38.44,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,But these restraints... just how \Nvicious will my treatment be?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.83,0:07:40.60,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,But even so, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.78,0:07:44.14,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,will not submit to mere torture!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.63,0:07:52.46,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,She'll likely be awake by now...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.06,0:07:56.29,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,My treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.77,0:08:11.59,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,What is this? What is the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.47,0:08:19.52,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,There. You're a lot cleaner than you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.88,0:08:21.69,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Seriously, what are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.14,0:08:24.45,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what you expect me to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.45,0:08:28.19,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,I was wiping the blood \Nand filth off of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.19,0:08:29.90,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,I mean, you were a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.90,0:08:30.78,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.06,0:08:36.28,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,And I have to say, I heard you \Nexchanged blows with my master...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.31,0:08:42.29,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,So I expected more of a brutish \Nwoman, but you're certainly...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.25,0:08:48.23,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Even from my view as another woman, \Nyou cut quite the feminine figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.23,0:08:52.83,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Are you mocking me?! \NA knight has no need of femininity!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.83,0:08:53.84,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.10,0:08:56.63,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Well, your say doesn't \Nreally factor into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.63,0:09:00.14,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,What matters is that \Nyou've caught his eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.51,0:09:03.46,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.46,0:09:05.90,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Would telling you really \Nmake a difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.35,0:09:07.24,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.60,0:09:10.22,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Nothing would change, even if I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.61,0:09:13.49,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,You will never leave here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.58,0:09:18.24,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Then... you really are here to...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.11,0:09:21.75,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Now, for the finishing touches.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.00,0:09:30.71,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Is this it for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.77,0:09:50.27,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,What are these clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.05,0:09:53.89,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,So she wasn't here to \Ninterrogate or torture me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.40,0:09:58.89,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,This scent...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.32,0:10:01.43,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Who puts scented oils on prisoners of war?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.39,0:10:05.67,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,But that's not the \Nreal question, which is:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.67,0:10:08.29,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,what am I being prepared for?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.31,0:10:13.05,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Now, then, I would say \Nyou're looking presentable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.56,0:10:17.56,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Is this some sort of barbarian \Nritual for prisoners?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.91,0:10:20.30,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Don't tell me—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.65,0:10:25.76,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,What was that?! Thunder?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.76,0:10:28.95,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,No, that shout could \Nbelong to no one else.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.98,0:10:33.21,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,It's him, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.37,0:10:44.42,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Well, now...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.08,0:10:49.38,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,It's like night and day, Crystal Helmet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.59,0:11:06.28,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,We had no time to exchange \Nnames during the battle...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.28,0:11:10.42,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I am heir to Great Chief Uldyn One Eye,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.42,0:11:12.21,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Thundering Voice Veor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.78,0:11:15.86,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Seeing him again like this, \Nhe's absolutely massive!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.45,0:11:20.29,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,And those golden eyes... \NHe can't be human.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.31,0:11:24.52,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I see what you people are after...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.25,0:11:31.34,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,My grandfather told me of the Eastern \NExpedition that happened 20 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.34,0:11:32.39,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,that he was part of...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.08,0:11:36.88,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,It sounded like a fairy tale, \Nbut, now the truth is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.41,0:11:48.13,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Those inhuman eyes reveal all!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.35,0:11:52.91,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I am of the Lavillant Margraves \Nof the Illdoren Kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.91,0:11:55.00,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,youngest daughter to the \Nformer lord, Mattius,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.00,0:11:57.24,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,commander of the Eastern Expeditionary \NForce's First Company,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.24,0:11:58.61,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Serafina de Lavillant!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.26,0:12:02.71,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,And I have no desire to beg for mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.03,0:12:05.49,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,However this sacrifice works, \Ndo with me as you will!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.78,0:12:16.15,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,That's right. No matter what happens to \Nme, I can at least maintain my dignity!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.15,0:12:17.89,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Serafina...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.89,0:12:20.80,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Sera, then. A good name.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.07,0:12:25.59,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,That said, Sera, \Nwhat's this talk of a sacrifice?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.10,0:12:31.60,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I've brought you here \Nto take you as my bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.11,0:12:41.07,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,B-Bride?! Who?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.07,0:12:42.26,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.26,0:12:42.86,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Whose?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.86,0:12:43.65,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.65,0:12:44.82,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I've heard of no such thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.34,0:12:48.04,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,You can't fool me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.04,0:12:49.53,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,You're trying to lower my guard
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.53,0:12:51.75,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,so I can be used in some bizarre ritual!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.75,0:12:55.45,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,If that was the idea, \Nwhy wait all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.14,0:12:58.97,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,But aren't we enemies?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.97,0:13:00.94,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Who says you can't wed your enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.94,0:13:02.46,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.73,0:13:07.70,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Well, that may be the case in \Nthe west, but it isn't our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.70,0:13:08.85,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.15,0:13:13.61,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,For generations, my clan...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.10,0:13:19.95,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,has made a tradition of taking \Nlady knights as our brides!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.27,0:13:26.17,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Th-This is madness!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.24,0:13:30.71,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Do you really think that insane \Nlogic is enough to convince me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.71,0:13:31.87,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,It's not?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.87,0:13:34.22,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.22,0:13:39.53,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,You already said I can \Ndo with you as I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.10,0:13:43.56,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Or was that all talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.51,0:13:46.01,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,I was careless!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.91,0:13:52.10,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,All that said, I don't make this decision \Nout of respect for law or tradition.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.51,0:13:55.64,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,When we crossed swords, \Nyour quality was apparent to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.26,0:14:01.36,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,The sword speaks in greater \Nvolume than thousands of words.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.87,0:14:05.77,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I sensed a profound \Nsincerity from your blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.24,0:14:11.28,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,It was enough that I fell \Nfor you in that moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.78,0:14:15.73,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Fell... for...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.50,0:14:23.70,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,That being the case, you won't be \Ntaken against your will, so relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.61,0:14:26.30,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,We'll speak later, Sera.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.91,0:14:32.05,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,W-Wait a moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.79,0:14:36.30,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Wh-Wha...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.01,0:14:41.01,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,What is going on here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.01,0:14:44.01,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,You're being courted, \Nif it wasn't obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.62,0:14:55.12,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\p1\an5\pos(123,296.667)\bord0\shad0\c&HD9F4F4&}m 10 0 l 160 0 l 170 10 l 170 50 l 160 60 l 160 60 l 10 60 l 0 50 l 0 10
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.62,0:14:55.12,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs14\fscy120\pos(123,296.667)\an5\c&H3E3C90&\3c&HD9F4F4&\shad0\bord1}Illdoren Kingdom\NProvince of Margrave Lavillant\NEau de Marie
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.61,0:14:55.12,Time/Setting,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,300)\an2\fs14\bord1\alpha&H22&}Seven Years Ago
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.51,0:15:01.12,Flashback,Sidius,0,0,0,,The king has sent forth orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.83,0:15:05.63,Flashback,Sidius,0,0,0,,The 17th Eastern Expedition \Nis to commence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.78,0:15:09.71,Flashback - Top,Sidius,0,0,0,,My sister, Serafina...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.14,0:15:12.89,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\p1\an5\pos(524.5,296.667)\bord0\shad0\c&HD9F4F4&}m 10 0 l 150 0 l 160 10 l 160 60 l 150 70 l 150 70 l 10 70 l 0 60 l 0 10
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.14,0:15:12.89,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs20\fscy120\pos(524.5,296.667)\an5\c&H3E3C90&\3c&HD9F4F4&\shad0\bord1}Margrave\NSidius de Lavillant
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.26,0:15:12.89,Flashback - Top,Sidius,0,0,0,,You have been named as captain \Nof the first company.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.42,0:15:19.39,Flashback,Sidius,0,0,0,,Earn glory that befits the Lavillant name.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.66,0:15:20.37,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.16,0:15:23.98,Flashback,Sidius,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.06,0:15:30.70,Flashback,Sidius,0,0,0,,There's an invitation to a banquet \Nfrom from Countess Ildhal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.73,0:15:33.28,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,What of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.84,0:15:37.79,Flashback,Sidius,0,0,0,,Well, it was addressed \Nto "Princess" Serafina.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.05,0:15:44.04,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,I will attend, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.06,0:15:52.97,Flashback,Merchant,0,0,0,,Get that thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.38,0:15:55.50,Flashback,Citizens,0,0,0,,Sounds like it pays well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.50,0:15:59.15,Flashback,Citizens,0,0,0,,I'm scared, though... A pal of mine \Nwho signed up never made it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.15,0:16:01.31,Flashback,Citizens,0,0,0,,An expedition to the east?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.31,0:16:03.50,Flashback,Citizens,0,0,0,,I'm gonna join the volunteer army!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.19,0:16:07.21,Flashback,Citizens,0,0,0,,Hey, it's the Lavillants' coach!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.87,0:16:31.58,Flashback,Noble Man,0,0,0,,My, what a rare guest to have.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.58,0:16:33.22,Flashback,Noble Lady,0,0,0,,She certainly is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.94,0:16:39.01,Flashback,Nobles,0,0,0,,The quality of food has \Nbeen so poor as of late.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.01,0:16:42.36,Flashback,Nobles,0,0,0,,But the longer the war goes on, \Nthe more we profit from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.36,0:16:43.72,Flashback,Nobles,0,0,0,,Indeed...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.02,0:16:49.40,Flashback,Noble Man 1,0,0,0,,Princess Serafina certainly cuts a figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.03,0:16:53.50,Flashback,Noble Woman 1,0,0,0,,She's more dashing than she is beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.03,0:16:55.68,Flashback,Knight 1,0,0,0,,Someone like that, commanding knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.68,0:16:57.48,Flashback,Knight 2,0,0,0,,What a state of affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.48,0:16:59.42,Flashback,Knight 2,0,0,0,,Imagine, being led by a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.42,0:17:03.30,Flashback,Knight 1,0,0,0,,That said, she is among the \Nstrongest of the order.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.30,0:17:07.16,Flashback,Knight 1,0,0,0,,And it's only natural for a Lavillant \Nto command an army, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.16,0:17:09.65,Flashback,Knight 1,0,0,0,,What's the point in a woman being strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.23,0:17:19.56,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,I want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.65,0:17:22.04,Flashback,Acquaintance 1,0,0,0,,Lady Serafina.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.87,0:17:26.07,Flashback,Acquaintance 1,0,0,0,,Here you are. We were looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.07,0:17:30.11,Flashback,Acquaintance 2,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be alone out here. \NPlease, join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.77,0:17:34.74,Flashback,Acquaintance 1,0,0,0,,It's been so long. \NI wonder how many years it's been.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.01,0:17:39.41,Flashback,Acquaintance 2,0,0,0,,I heard you were named a commander \Nfor the Eastern Expedition?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.41,0:17:40.33,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.33,0:17:46.75,Flashback,Acquaintance 1,0,0,0,,How dreadful! Isn't the east full \Nof violent, undiscovered creatures?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.76,0:17:50.44,Flashback,Acquaintance 2,0,0,0,,Rumors tell of fire-breathing \Ndragons and other monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.44,0:17:53.13,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,Dragons and monsters are \Nthe stuff of fables.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.13,0:17:55.96,Flashback,Acquaintance 1,0,0,0,,But it'll still be dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.96,0:17:59.01,Flashback,Acquaintance 1,0,0,0,,Since you're going to \Nfight the barbarians...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.30,0:18:03.15,Flashback,Acquaintance 1,0,0,0,,Aren't they supposed to be more \Nlike animals in human form?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.15,0:18:06.25,Flashback,Acuqaintence 2,0,0,0,,And they kidnap lady knights \Nand use them as sacrifices!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.25,0:18:09.03,Flashback,Acquaintance 1,0,0,0,,If the eastern lands are \Nreally that terrible,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.03,0:18:11.30,Flashback,Acquaintance 1,0,0,0,,no woman should set foot upon them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.35,0:18:16.41,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,Conquering the east
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.41,0:18:19.16,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,has been a goal of the \NIlldoren Kingdom since its founding...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.80,0:18:23.05,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,As a member of the nobility, \Nit is an honor to be sent there
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.05,0:18:25.62,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,for the sake of the \Npeople and their peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.77,0:18:29.81,Flashback,Acquaintance 1,0,0,0,,You should leave that sort of \Nthing to the men to handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.81,0:18:33.15,Flashback,Acquaintance 1,0,0,0,,What possible good could come \Nfrom fighting as a woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.15,0:18:35.87,Flashback,Acquaintance 1,0,0,0,,Even Princess Wysteresia, \Nwhom you so looked up to,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.87,0:18:39.21,Flashback,Acquaintance 1,0,0,0,,ended up going missing on the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.21,0:18:41.56,Flashback,Acquaintance 1,0,0,0,,There is no greater happiness as a woman
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.56,0:18:43.40,Flashback,Acquaintance 1,0,0,0,,than to get married and \Nmanage a household.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.13,0:18:52.81,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,They have it so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.83,0:18:56.66,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,A veritable feast accompanied \Nwith lively music...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.78,0:19:05.70,Flashback_Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,While the people only grow hungrier, \Nas our crops continue to fail...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.70,0:19:08.08,Flashback,Merchant,0,0,0,,S-Someone, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.30,0:19:16.59,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.51,0:19:21.30,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,Resist and I won't guarantee your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.07,0:19:24.62,Flashback_Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,These people are...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.73,0:19:29.35,Flashback,Bandit 1,0,0,0,,That sword... She's a noble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.35,0:19:32.17,Flashback,Bandit 2,0,0,0,,It don't matter! We gotta do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.34,0:19:45.07,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,This is your first time stooping \Nto this sort of thing, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.30,0:19:48.12,Flashback,Bandit 1,0,0,0,,It's better than dying of hunger!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.12,0:19:49.83,Flashback,Bandit 2,0,0,0,,You'd never understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.09,0:20:02.51,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,And you'll never do evil again?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.51,0:20:04.59,Flashback,Bandit 1,0,0,0,,We can really take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.59,0:20:05.35,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.31,0:20:07.71,Flashback,Bandit 1,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.71,0:20:10.12,Flashback,Bandit 2,0,0,0,,I'll be able to feed my kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.45,0:20:13.08,Flashback,Bandit 1,0,0,0,,We'll never do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.52,0:20:15.48,Flashback,Bandit 1,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.48,0:20:16.28,Flashback,Bandit 2,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.85,0:20:20.20,Flashback,Bandit 3,0,0,0,,We really owe her...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.20,0:20:21.10,Flashback,Bandit 2,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.83,0:20:24.62,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,Just endure a bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.05,0:20:27.01,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,I will conquer the east
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.74,0:20:31.67,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,so that you all can live fuller lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.57,0:20:40.88,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,I take my leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.42,0:20:45.85,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,I will fight with all I have for \Nthe people and for the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.85,0:20:46.89,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,Please, watch over me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.26,0:20:50.56,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,Princess Wysteresia.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.56,0:20:51.96,Flashback,Sidius,0,0,0,,Serafina.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.97,0:20:56.15,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.78,0:20:59.90,Flashback,Sidius,0,0,0,,Did you fail to find a \Nhusband again at the party?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.93,0:21:04.08,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,What are you saying? \NI was about to head out to—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.08,0:21:04.95,Flashback,Sidius,0,0,0,,Silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.67,0:21:07.76,Flashback,Sidius,0,0,0,,A woman, wanting to be a knight?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.76,0:21:10.02,Flashback,Sidius,0,0,0,,How long will you insist \Non this selfishness?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.02,0:21:11.30,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,What are you saying...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.30,0:21:13.80,Flashback,Sidius,0,0,0,,You've more than established \Nyourself at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.11,0:21:16.29,Flashback,Sidius,0,0,0,,You need to marry while \Nthere are viable prospects.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.63,0:21:18.71,Flashback,Sidius,0,0,0,,A sword has never changed policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.71,0:21:21.34,Flashback,Sidius,0,0,0,,Sera...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.34,0:21:26.42,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Sera... Sera... Sera!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.42,0:21:30.18,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Be my bride!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.18,0:21:32.18,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Wh-What the—?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.18,0:21:37.19,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,You will be my bride!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.21,0:21:47.13,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,A dream? Of the barbarian? But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.30,0:21:54.41,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,What is that sound?
